{
  "task_id": "sales-pivot-analysis",
  "top_k": 5,
  "requirements": [
    {
      "requirement_id": "req_97b3e5d0f99ecb9fa9c5",
      "requirement_type": "FORMAT",
      "criticality": "CORE",
      "provenance": {
        "source_file": "tasks/sales-pivot-analysis/instruction.md",
        "source_type": "instruction",
        "line_start": 1,
        "line_end": 1,
        "exact_text": "read through the population data in `/root/population.pdf` and income daya in `/root/income.xlsx` and create a new report called `/root/demographic_analysis.xlsx`\n",
        "source_sha256": "e08dac12ed00aa70e66b121467503f149e4f7415146b98fbc7ad14fd68ecadf9",
        "extraction_rule": "actionable_paragraph"
      }
    },
    {
      "requirement_id": "req_afe4d595247630c3835e",
      "requirement_type": "DOMAIN_ACTION",
      "criticality": "SUPPORT",
      "provenance": {
        "source_file": "tasks/sales-pivot-analysis/instruction.md",
        "source_type": "instruction",
        "line_start": 5,
        "line_end": 9,
        "exact_text": "1. \"Population by State\"\nThis sheet contains a pivot table with the following structure:\nRows: STATE\nValues: Sum of POPULATION_2023\n\n",
        "source_sha256": "e08dac12ed00aa70e66b121467503f149e4f7415146b98fbc7ad14fd68ecadf9",
        "extraction_rule": "commonmark_list_item"
      }
    },
    {
      "requirement_id": "req_799070deb41fe7e67e64",
      "requirement_type": "DOMAIN_ACTION",
      "criticality": "SUPPORT",
      "provenance": {
        "source_file": "tasks/sales-pivot-analysis/instruction.md",
        "source_type": "instruction",
        "line_start": 10,
        "line_end": 14,
        "exact_text": "2. \"Earners by State\"\nThis sheet contains a pivot table with the following structure:\nRows: STATE\nValues: Sum of EARNERS\n\n",
        "source_sha256": "e08dac12ed00aa70e66b121467503f149e4f7415146b98fbc7ad14fd68ecadf9",
        "extraction_rule": "commonmark_list_item"
      }
    },
    {
      "requirement_id": "req_4a9a3ca42a4d2a4f48b5",
      "requirement_type": "DOMAIN_ACTION",
      "criticality": "SUPPORT",
      "provenance": {
        "source_file": "tasks/sales-pivot-analysis/instruction.md",
        "source_type": "instruction",
        "line_start": 15,
        "line_end": 19,
        "exact_text": "3. \"Regions by State\"\nThis sheet contains a pivot table with the following structure:\nRows: STATE\nValues: Count (number of SA2 regions)\n\n",
        "source_sha256": "e08dac12ed00aa70e66b121467503f149e4f7415146b98fbc7ad14fd68ecadf9",
        "extraction_rule": "commonmark_list_item"
      }
    },
    {
      "requirement_id": "req_13a169c41ffb0bf3774d",
      "requirement_type": "DOMAIN_ACTION",
      "criticality": "SUPPORT",
      "provenance": {
        "source_file": "tasks/sales-pivot-analysis/instruction.md",
        "source_type": "instruction",
        "line_start": 20,
        "line_end": 25,
        "exact_text": "4. \"State Income Quartile\"\nThis sheet contains a pivot table with the following structure:\nRows: STATE\nColumns: Quarter. Use the terms \"Q1\", \"Q2\", \"Q3\" and \"Q4\" as the quartiles based on MEDIAN_INCOME ranges across all regions.\nValues: Sum of EARNERS\n\n",
        "source_sha256": "e08dac12ed00aa70e66b121467503f149e4f7415146b98fbc7ad14fd68ecadf9",
        "extraction_rule": "commonmark_list_item"
      }
    },
    {
      "requirement_id": "req_647ae4e0be324ebd27c6",
      "requirement_type": "DOMAIN_ACTION",
      "criticality": "SUPPORT",
      "provenance": {
        "source_file": "tasks/sales-pivot-analysis/instruction.md",
        "source_type": "instruction",
        "line_start": 26,
        "line_end": 29,
        "exact_text": "5. \"SourceData\"\nThis sheet contains a regular table with the original data\nenriched with the following columns:\n\n",
        "source_sha256": "e08dac12ed00aa70e66b121467503f149e4f7415146b98fbc7ad14fd68ecadf9",
        "extraction_rule": "commonmark_list_item"
      }
    },
    {
      "requirement_id": "req_7efab14f1e18dff6a5aa",
      "requirement_type": "DOMAIN_ACTION",
      "criticality": "SUPPORT",
      "provenance": {
        "source_file": "tasks/sales-pivot-analysis/instruction.md",
        "source_type": "instruction",
        "line_start": 30,
        "line_end": 30,
        "exact_text": "- Quarter - Use the terms \"Q1\", \"Q2\", \"Q3 and \"Q4\" as the Quarters and base them on MEDIAN_INCOME quartile range\n",
        "source_sha256": "e08dac12ed00aa70e66b121467503f149e4f7415146b98fbc7ad14fd68ecadf9",
        "extraction_rule": "commonmark_list_item"
      }
    },
    {
      "requirement_id": "req_7d6149c9631d9213875b",
      "requirement_type": "DOMAIN_ACTION",
      "criticality": "SUPPORT",
      "provenance": {
        "source_file": "tasks/sales-pivot-analysis/instruction.md",
        "source_type": "instruction",
        "line_start": 31,
        "line_end": 32,
        "exact_text": "- Total - EARNERS × MEDIAN_INCOME\n\n",
        "source_sha256": "e08dac12ed00aa70e66b121467503f149e4f7415146b98fbc7ad14fd68ecadf9",
